#, c-format
msgid ""
"It needs %s, part of %s, which the console doesn't have. Copy it from %s "
"on a Windows PC that has it installed into the game's folder, beside its "
"program."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:3337
#, c-format
msgid ""
"It needs %s, which isn't in its folder or the console's Windows. If the "
"game came with it, copy it beside its program; on a Windows PC that runs "
"the game it is in %s."
msgstr ""

