#, c-format
msgid ""
"If PC5 started the wrong program, choose Change program in the game's menu "
"(Triangle). Its log is kept as %.120s in %.120s."
msgstr ""
"Hvis PC5 startet feil program, velger du Bytt program i spillets meny "
"(Trekant). Loggen er lagret som %.120s i %.120s."

