#, c-format
msgid "%s had to be closed"
msgstr "%s måtte lukkes"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:3362
#, c-format
msgid ""
"It didn't close when asked, so PC5 ended it. Its log is kept as %.120s in "
"%.120s."
msgstr ""
"Det lukket seg ikke da det ble bedt om det, så PC5 avsluttet det. Loggen "
"er lagret som %.120s i %.120s."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:3366
#, c-format
msgid "%s closed soon after starting"
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:3367 title/pc5_ui.c:3372
#, c-format
msgid "Its log is kept as %.120s in %.120s."
msgstr "Loggen er lagret som %.120s i %.120s."

