#: title/pc5_ui.c:7494 title/pc5_ui.c:9176 title/pc5_ui.c:9204
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Avinstaller"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7495
msgid "Deletes the game, or keeps its saves for later"
msgstr "Sletter spillet, eller beholder lagringsfilene til senere"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7508
msgid "What the game sees when you play with the controller."
msgstr "Hva spillet ser når du spiller med kontrolleren."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7509
msgid "Xbox controller: what most PC games expect. Try this first."
msgstr "Xbox-kontroller: det de fleste PC-spill forventer. Prøv denne først."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7510
msgid ""
"DualSense: a PS5 controller plugged into a PC, with PlayStation buttons in "
"games that support it."
msgstr ""
"DualSense: en PS5-kontroller koblet til en PC, med PlayStation-knapper i "
"spill som støtter det."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7511
msgid ""
"Keyboard & mouse: for games with no controller support. The buttons press "
"keys and the sticks move the mouse; Button mapping changes which key each "
"one sends."
msgstr ""
"Tastatur og mus: for spill uten kontrollerstøtte. Knappene trykker på "
"taster og spakene flytter musen; i Knappetilordning velger du hvilken tast "
"hver knapp sender."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7514
msgid ""
"What each button, stick and the touchpad sends to the game with Keyboard & "
"mouse."
msgstr ""
"Hva hver knapp, hver spak og styreplaten sender til spillet med Tastatur "
"og mus."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7515
msgid ""
"Touchpad: One button (a click sends one key), Halves and swipes (a key for "
"each half's click and each quick swipe up, down, left or right), or Mouse "
"(a finger moves the pointer, like a laptop's)."
msgstr ""
"Styreplate: Én knapp (et klikk sender én tast), Halvdeler og sveip (en "
"tast for klikk på hver halvdel og for hvert raske sveip opp, ned, til "
"venstre eller til høyre) eller Mus (en finger flytter pekeren, som på en "
"bærbar PC)."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7516
msgid "Two-finger click: PC5's on-screen keyboard, or a key of its own."
msgstr "Klikk med to fingre: PC5s skjermtastatur eller en egen tast."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7517
msgid "Save as my mapping keeps your layout for every game set up after it."
msgstr ""
"Lagre som min tilordning beholder oppsettet ditt for hvert spill som "
"settes opp etterpå."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7520
msgid "Whether the game sees the Create button."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7521
msgid ""
"Sent: the game sees it, as Back (Select) on an Xbox controller or as "
"Create on a DualSense."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7522
msgid ""
"Not sent: the game never sees it, so taking a screenshot with the PS5's "
"Create button doesn't press anything in the game."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7525
msgid "Whether the mouse pointer shows over the game."
msgstr "Om musepekeren vises over spillet."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7526
msgid "Normal: the game decides, as on a PC."
msgstr "Normal: spillet bestemmer, som på en PC."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7527
msgid ""
"Auto-hide: hidden after 5 seconds without moving or clicking, for a game "
"that leaves it on the screen."
msgstr ""
"Skjul automatisk: skjules etter 5 sekunder uten bevegelse eller klikk, for "
"et spill som lar den stå på skjermen."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7530
msgid ""
"How the game's pictures are made on the console. Auto is right for almost "
"every game; the others are for a game that won't start or shows a wrong "
"picture."
msgstr ""
"Hvordan spillets bilder lages på konsollen. Auto passer for nesten alle "
"spill; de andre er for et spill som ikke starter eller viser feil bilde."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7532
msgid ""
"Alternative: another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong "
"with Auto."
msgstr ""
"Alternativ: en annen måte å tegne spillet på. Prøv den hvis bildet blir "
"feil med Auto."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7533
msgid ""
"2D only: for a 2D game that flickers or shows only part of its screen."
msgstr ""
"Kun 2D: for et 2D-spill som flimrer eller bare viser en del av skjermen "
"sin."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7535
msgid ""
"Alternative: slower than Auto. Try it if the game won't start or its "
"picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Alternativ: tregere enn Auto. Prøv den hvis spillet ikke starter eller "
"bildet blir feil."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7537
msgid ""
"Auto: OpenGL is ready for the game in case it asks for it while it runs."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7538
msgid ""
"Windows only: without OpenGL. Try it if the game starts or draws worse "
"with Auto."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7540
msgid ""
"Alternative: another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong "
"with Auto. Some mods need it."
msgstr ""
"Alternativ: en annen måte å tegne spillet på. Prøv den hvis bildet blir "
"feil med Auto. Noen modder trenger den."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7541
msgid "Compatibility (slow): the slowest, but it starts the most games."
msgstr "Kompatibel (treg): tregest, men starter flest spill."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7543
msgid "Choose the row to see each one with what it does."
msgstr "Velg raden for å se hvert valg og hva det gjør."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7546
msgid ""
"Makes extra frames between the game's own, so movement looks smoother. It "
"can add a little delay to the controls."
msgstr ""
"Lager ekstra bilder mellom spillets egne, så bevegelser ser jevnere ut. "
"Det kan gi litt forsinkelse i kontrollene."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7547
msgid "30 → 60 fps: the game is held at 30 fps and shown at 60."
msgstr "30 → 60 fps: spillet holdes på 30 fps og vises i 60."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7548
msgid ""
"60 → 120 fps: held at 60 and shown at 120, on a 120 Hz TV with 120 Hz "
"output on in Settings."
msgstr ""
"60 → 120 fps: holdt på 60 og vist i 120, på en 120 Hz-TV med 120 Hz-utgang "
"slått på i Innstillinger."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7549
msgid ""
"40 → 120 fps: held at 40, two frames made between each two, for a game "
"that can't hold 60."
msgstr ""
"40 → 120 fps: holdt på 40, to bilder laget mellom hver to, for et spill "
"som ikke klarer å holde 60."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7552
msgid ""
"The size the game is drawn at. The console always shows 4K, so a smaller "
"picture is scaled up."
msgstr ""
"Størrelsen spillet tegnes i. Konsollen viser alltid 4K, så et mindre bilde "
"skaleres opp."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7553
msgid "1080p: the fastest, and right for most games."
msgstr "1080p: raskest, og riktig for de fleste spill."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7554
msgid "1440p: sharper, but slower."
msgstr "1440p: skarpere, men tregere."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7555
msgid ""
"4K: the sharpest, four times the work of 1080p: only for light games."
msgstr ""
"4K: skarpest, fire ganger så mye arbeid som 1080p: bare for lette spill."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7558
msgid "The shape of the picture on the TV."
msgstr "Bildets form på TV-en."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7559
msgid ""
"Keep: the picture's own shape. An older 4:3 game gets black bars at the "
"sides."
msgstr ""
"Behold: bildets egen form. Et eldre 4:3-spill får svarte felt på sidene."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7560
msgid "Stretch: fills the whole screen, so a 4:3 picture gets wider."
msgstr "Strekk: fyller hele skjermen, så et 4:3-bilde blir bredere."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7563
msgid "How much memory an older 32-bit game may use."
msgstr "Hvor mye minne et eldre 32-biters spill kan bruke."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7564
msgid "Auto: as on Windows, 4 GB for a game made for it, otherwise 2 GB."
msgstr ""
"Auto: som på Windows, 4 GB for et spill som er laget for det, ellers 2 GB."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7565
msgid ""
"4 GB: for a game that runs out of memory, often with big mods. Set it back "
"to Auto if the game misbehaves."
msgstr ""
"4 GB: for et spill som går tom for minne, ofte med store modder. Sett "
"tilbake til Auto hvis spillet oppfører seg rart."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7568
msgid ""
"How much graphics memory the game is told the console has. The PS5's "
"memory is shared by the game and its graphics, so more for graphics leaves "
"less for the game."
msgstr ""
"Hvor mye grafikkminne spillet får beskjed om at konsollen har. PS5-ens "
"minne deles av spillet og grafikken, så mer til grafikk gir mindre til "
"spillet."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7570
msgid ""
"512 MB or 1 GB: less for textures, more for the game, for one that runs "
"out of memory."
msgstr ""
"512 MB eller 1 GB: mindre til teksturer, mer til spillet, hvis minnet går "
"tomt."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7571
msgid ""
"Auto: 2 GB at most, so older games don't get confused by a large number."
msgstr ""
"Auto: høyst 2 GB, så eldre spill ikke blir forvirret av et stort tall."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7572
msgid ""
"3 GB or Maximum: for a game that says there is too little. Set it back to "
"Auto if it misbehaves."
msgstr ""
"3 GB eller Maksimum: til et spill som ser for lite. Velg Auto igjen hvis "
"det krangler."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7574
msgid ""
"2 GB or 3 GB: less for textures, more for the game, for one that runs out "
"of memory."
msgstr ""
"2 GB eller 3 GB: mindre til teksturer, mer til spillet, hvis minnet går "
"tomt."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7575
msgid "Auto: 4 GB, room for both."
msgstr "Auto: 4 GB, plass til begge."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7576
msgid ""
"5 GB or 6 GB: more for textures. Set it back to Auto if the game runs out "
"of memory."
msgstr ""
"5 GB eller 6 GB: mer til teksturer. Sett tilbake til Auto hvis spillet går "
"tom for minne."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7577
msgid ""
"Maximum: all of it, only for a game that won't start because it sees too "
"little."
msgstr ""
"Maksimum: alt, bare for et spill som ikke starter fordi det ser for lite."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7581
msgid "How many speakers the game is told the console has."
msgstr "Hvor mange høyttalere spillet tror konsollen har."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7582
msgid "Stereo: two, right for a TV or headphones."
msgstr "Stereo: to, for TV eller hodetelefoner."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7583
msgid ""
"5.1 or 7.1: the game plays each sound on its own speaker of a surround "
"system, and the PS5 sends it on as it does its own games' sound."
msgstr ""
"5.1 eller 7.1: spillet spiller hver lyd i sin egen høyttaler i et "
"surroundanlegg, og PS5 sender den videre som lyden fra sine egne spill."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7584
msgid ""
"If the game is silent or plays only from the front, set it back to Stereo."
msgstr "Hvis spillet er stille eller bare høres forfra, velg Stereo igjen."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7587
msgid ""
"Changes how the game's work is shared out on the console's processor."
msgstr "Endrer hvordan spillets arbeid fordeles på konsollens prosessor."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7588
msgid "Off: the fastest for most games."
msgstr "Av: raskest for de fleste spill."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7589
msgid ""
"On: the game's work takes turns, as on a PC. Try it if the game freezes, "
"stutters or hangs while loading; it can be a little slower."
msgstr ""
"På: spillets arbeid går på omgang, som på en PC. Prøv det hvis spillet "
"fryser, hakker eller henger under lasting; det kan bli litt tregere."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7592
msgid ""
"Many PC games need Steam running to start. The console has no Steam, so "
"PC5 stands in for it."
msgstr ""
"Mange PC-spill trenger at Steam kjører for å starte. Konsollen har ikke "
"Steam, så PC5 tar over rollen."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7593
msgid "Auto: the game starts as if Steam were running, offline."
msgstr "Auto: spillet starter som om Steam kjørte, uten nett."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7594
msgid ""
"Off: the game's own Steam files are used. It won't find Steam and may not "
"start; only for a game that misbehaves with Auto."
msgstr ""
"Av: spillets egne Steam-filer brukes. Det finner ikke Steam og starter "
"kanskje ikke; bare for et spill som oppfører seg rart med Auto."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7597
msgid ""
"A player who got this game running put their settings in the game "
"compatibility list (Report it works)."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7598
msgid ""
"Choose it to see what they changed, and use the same settings. The game's "
"other settings stay as they are."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7601
msgid ""
"Makes the game's Windows new, as a fresh install has it. Use it when a "
"game that used to work stops starting."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7602
msgid ""
"What stays: the game's files, its saves in its Windows user folders "
"(AppData, Documents, Saved Games) and PC5's settings for it."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7603
msgid ""
"What goes back to its default: the Windows settings the game kept in the "
"registry. Some games keep options or saves there; the old registry is kept "
"in the game's pc5/reset-backup folder."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7665
msgid "About"
msgstr "Info"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7665 title/pc5_ui.c:8439
msgid "Receive from phone"
msgstr "Motta fra telefon"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7693
msgid "Touchpad + OPTIONS for 2 s still leaves the game"
msgstr "Styreplate + OPTIONS i 2 s går fortsatt ut av spillet"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7695
msgid "Two fingers: PC5's on-screen keyboard, or a key of its own"
msgstr "To fingre: PC5s skjermtastatur eller en egen tast"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7698
msgid "A key for each half's click and each quick swipe"
msgstr "En tast for klikk på hver halvdel og for hvert raske sveip"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7699
msgid "A finger moves the pointer; a click sends its key"
msgstr "En finger flytter pekeren; et klikk sender sin tast"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7700
msgid "The whole touchpad is one button"
msgstr "Hele styreplaten er én knapp"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7710
msgid "Right stick"
msgstr "Høyre spak"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7710
msgid "Left stick"
msgstr "Venstre spak"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7718
msgid "Pointer speed"
msgstr "Pekerhastighet"

#. which picture is shown: 3 of 12.
